diff --git a/docs/en-US/component/floating-panel.md b/docs/en-US/component/floating-panel.md
index e4b02e99..dd4841e7 100644
--- a/docs/en-US/component/floating-panel.md
+++ b/docs/en-US/component/floating-panel.md
@@ -4,76 +4,151 @@ A draggable or anchored collapsible information panel that can either float free
 
 ## Basic Usage
 
+The panel is uncontrolled by default: it keeps its own collapse state and the host only listens.
+
 :::demo
 
 floating-panel/basic
 
 :::
 
+## Controlled and Closable
+
+`v-model` owns visibility and `v-model:collapsed` owns the collapse state. Once bound, the host owns that state: the panel only reports intent through `update:modelValue` / `update:collapsed` and never changes it on its own. `show-close` renders a close button.
+
+:::demo
+
+floating-panel/controlled
+
+:::
+
+## Status and Resizing
+
+`loading`, `completed` and `error` drive the header status area. While collapsed the state shows as a badge, so there is no need to force the panel open. `resizable` adds a bottom-corner resize handle.
+
+:::demo
+
+floating-panel/workbench
+
+:::
+
+## Anchored Placement
+
+With `position-strategy="anchored"` the panel is placed from `anchor + placement + offset`. Pair it with `teleport` to escape a container's `overflow` clipping.
+
+:::demo
+
+floating-panel/anchored
+
+:::
+
 ### FloatingPanel Attributes
 
-| Attribute            | Description                                                                                      | Type                                                      | Default           |
-| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |
-| `title`              | Title text (effective when `header` slot is not provided)                                        | `string`                                                  | `''`              |
-| `defaultCollapsed`   | Whether initially collapsed                                                                      | `boolean`                                                 | `true`            |
-| `headerClickable`    | Toggle collapse state when clicking header                                                       | `boolean`                                                 | `false`           |
-| `customClass`        | Custom class name appended to panel root element                                                 | `string`                                                  | `''`              |
-| `position`           | Panel positioning style, common keys: `top`/`right`/`bottom`/`left`                              | `Record<string, any>`                                     | `{}`              |
-| `size`               | Expanded size, common keys: `width`/`height`/`maxHeight`                                         | `Record<string, any>`                                     | `{}`              |
-| `collapsedSize`      | Collapsed size, common keys: `width`/`height`                                                    | `Record<string, any>`                                     | `{}`              |
-| `zIndex`             | Panel z-index                                                                                    | `number`                                                  | `2000`            |
-| `expandIcon`         | Icon for expanded state (used when `autoDirection=false`)                                        | `string \| Component`                                     | `undefined`       |
-| `collapseIconProp`   | Icon for collapsed state (used when `autoDirection=false`)                                       | `string \| Component`                                     | `undefined`       |
-| `showCollapseBtn`    | Whether to show the collapse button                                                              | `boolean`                                                 | `true`            |
-| `showStatus`         | Show status area (loading/completed)                                                             | `boolean`                                                 | `true`            |
-| `loading`            | Loading state                                                                                    | `boolean`                                                 | `false`           |
-| `completed`          | Completed state                                                                                  | `boolean`                                                 | `false`           |
-| `loadingText`        | Loading text                                                                                     | `string`                                                  | `'Processing...'` |
-| `completedText`      | Completed text                                                                                   | `string`                                                  | `'Completed'`     |
-| `expandTooltip`      | Expand button tooltip                                                                            | `string`                                                  | `'Expand'`        |
-| `collapseTooltip`    | Collapse button tooltip                                                                          | `string`                                                  | `'Collapse'`      |
-| `autoExpand`         | Whether to auto expand when `loading` becomes `true`                                             | `boolean`                                                 | `false`           |
-| `completedDuration`  | Display duration (ms) when `loading` ends and `completed=true`                                   | `number`                                                  | `3000`            |
-| `transitionDuration` | Collapse/move transition duration (ms)                                                           | `number`                                                  | `300`             |
-| `autoDirection`      | Automatically switch arrow direction based on panel position (left/right)                        | `boolean`                                                 | `true`            |
-| `positionStrategy`   | Positioning mode: free drag or anchor-following                                                  | `'free' \| 'anchored'`                                    | `'free'`          |
-| `anchor`             | Anchor target for `positionStrategy='anchored'`; supports selector, element, ref, or getter      | `string \| Element \| VirtualElement \| Ref \| () => ...` | `null`            |
-| `placement`          | Floating UI placement used in anchored mode                                                      | `Placement`                                               | `'bottom-end'`    |
-| `offset`             | Offset in anchored mode; array format is `[crossAxis, mainAxis]`                                 | `number \| [number, number]`                              | `16`              |
-| `shift`              | Whether anchored mode shifts the panel back into the viewport                                    | `boolean`                                                 | `true`            |
-| `flip`               | Whether anchored mode flips placement when space is insufficient                                 | `boolean`                                                 | `true`            |
-| `shiftPadding`       | Viewport padding for anchored shift                                                              | `number`                                                  | `8`               |
-| `teleport`           | Teleport target; pair with anchored mode to escape overflow clipping                             | `boolean \| string`                                       | `false`           |
-| `responsive`         | Responsive breakpoint config (e.g. `{ '768px': true }`), generates `responsive-<minWidth>` class | `Record<string, any>`                                     | `{}`              |
+| Attribute            | Description                                                                          | Type                                                      | Default        |
