+/* Fill layout contract. A root offers its definite height to descendants
+   through container query units; an anchor takes that height without
+   depending on the wrappers in between (router views, transitions); links
+   pass the remaining height down a flex column. Layout only: nothing is
+   measured and nothing observes. */
